  "_pose": "pose.roll: degrees about the long axis from the subject's rest pose (body subjects rest supine/AP; the hand rests PA); +roll lifts world +x. pose.cc: central-ray angle, negative = cephalic. pose.centre: a landmark in landmarks.json (measured by tools/measure_landmarks.py) that the patient is moved to put under the central ray. pose.fidelity \"approx\" marks a view a rigid model cannot truly achieve; pose.note says why."
